# Signing / Play / FCM material — belt and braces with the root .gitignore
# (board #109). google-services.json is client config and is allowed; the
# server-side FCM credential is not part of this repo.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
keystore.properties
key.properties
service-account*.json
